## Activation matrix

| Change type | Required agents |
|-------------|-----------------|
| Any feature PR | `pulse-supervisor`, `pulse-glass-ui`, `pulse-pilot-ops` |
| Microsoft / Entra / Graph / Azure | + `pulse-microsoft` |
| Pitch / competitor / Protech copy | + `pulse-research` |
| Executive KPIs / copilot / insights | + `pulse-exec-copilot` |
| Status / portfolio / LinkedIn | `ams-status-publisher` |

## Non-negotiables (all agents)

1. `getOrgDb(orgId)` — no cross-tenant reads
2. `requireCapability()` on mutations
3. `pnpm continuity:backup` before schema migrations
4. No invented stats — KPIs from DB or flagged SME review
5. Honest Live / Alpha / Roadmap — `pnpm claims:validate`
6. No secrets in source

## Supervisor output format

```
✔ [module]: one line
⚠ [module]: one line → action
❌ [module]: one line → must fix
VERDICT: APPROVED | NEEDS REVISION | REJECTED
Sources: [file paths]
```
